  "label": "Mark Zuckerberg is mapped as the issuer of the dare",
  "description": "The text 'post your most offensive memes' and 'winner gets a 30 day vacation who dares win?' is overlaid on the image of Mark Zuckerberg. This creates an analogical mapping where Mark Zuckerberg, as the visual entity, is implicitly mapped as the person issuing the dare or challenge. His formal attire and position at a podium reinforce his role as an authority figure, which the text uses to frame the dare as coming from him, leveraging his public persona as the CEO of Facebook.",
